            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Persian for to stick, then the Persian for to spin."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: هنوز",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "هنوز — hanuz — \"still; (with a negative) not yet\". Persian negates a verb with ن (na-, ne-): من هنوز آماده نیستم — man hanuz âmâde nistam — \"I'm not ready yet.\" نیستم is the negative of هستم."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for this chapter."
            }
          ]
        },
